# M7 online, mode 2 (shared save): every player has an own instance on the
# host's save, on every machine. Every machine's first player solves 0level
# in its own instance; m0's first player then wins 1level and every other
# machine's map shows it (progress event through the host, merged at the
# player's next turn, the map refreshed by its own machine). Then everybody
# presses at once; every machine must agree at the end.
size 1280x720
# The first launch plays the intro: hold a key to skip it.
wait 150
hold enter 70
idle 400
expect state play baba/0level
@host online host private ${ROOMFILE}
@m1 online join code ${ROOMFILE}
@!m0,m1 online join invite ${ROOMFILE}
@host online wait 90 machines=${MACHINES}
@host online mode shared
online seats ${LOCALS}
@host shot 01-room
online wait 90 online session
online wait 60 players=${PLAYERS}
online settle 30
shot 02-session
l1 idle 900
l1 solve
online wait-level 90 l1 baba/106level
online settle 30
@m0 l1 idle 900
@m0 l1 walk 1level
@m0 l1 press wait
@m0 online wait-level 60 l1 baba/1level
@m0 l1 idle 900
@m0 l1 solve
online wait-icon 90 l1 1level 3
online settle 30
shot 03-shared-progress
online bots 8
online settle 60
shot 04-bots
@host online end
online wait 90 online room
online expect agreed
@host expect save 0 baba 1level 3
quit
